1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:00,498
You spin

2
00:00:00,498 --> 00:00:01,125
in your chair

3
00:00:01,125 --> 00:00:01,910
and stop.

4
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:02,980
The room

5
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,090
DOESN'T!

6
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:05,352
Your head stopped...

7
00:00:05,352 --> 00:00:05,992
but the liquid

8
00:00:05,992 --> 00:00:06,940
in your ears

9
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,000
DIDN'T!

10
00:00:08,083 --> 00:00:08,800
It sloshes

11
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,760
round three tiny loops,

12
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,750
bending little hairs

13
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,101
that tell your brain:

14
00:00:13,101 --> 00:00:14,326
TURNING!

15
00:00:14,326 --> 00:00:15,109
Stop,

16
00:00:15,109 --> 00:00:16,967
and it keeps sloshing.

17
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,380
Your ears yell

18
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:20,030
SPINNING...

19
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,080
your eyes yell

20
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,100
NOPE.

21
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:23,140
Ballet dancers'

22
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,604
brains may learn

23
00:00:24,604 --> 00:00:26,230
to turn that signal

24
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,267
DOWN.

25
00:00:27,406 --> 00:00:28,696
So sit down...

26
00:00:28,696 --> 00:00:30,240
and let your ears

27
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,272
finish their lap.

